  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Z Boaz is Fort Worth's rugged classic — 19 holes with real elevation, heavy trees, and a creek that comes into play on four of the last five holes. It's been a DFW staple since 1999 and the terrain has broken plenty of hearts since.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and DISCatcher baskets, the course is famous for hole 4 — a 755-foot par 3 that's one of the most talked-about holes in Texas disc golf. The rest of the course is no walk in the park either.",
    "Bring your longest drivers and your patience. Z Boaz doesn't care about your score from last week."
  ],
